	"나는 이 외로운\n우주 공간의 공기를\n"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"최상의 상태로 유지하며\n하루하루를 보내."
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"..."
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"...*삐 삐*?"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"여긴 어쩐 일이야?\n"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"서, 설마 우리\n지구로 돌아온 거야?\n"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"..."
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"..."
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"아니야? 아... "
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"인간들이 있을 때는\n내 존재에도\n"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"의미가 있었는데, 이제 나는\n무슨 쓸모가 있을까?\n"
	keyWait
		type = 1
	clearMsg
	"...*삐 삐*"
	keyWait
		type = 0
	end
	end
}
